\begin_layout Subsection
Figure 3: The Space Charge of the First Corona Streamer
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsubsection
Parameters
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
For Figure 3 the paper gives a rod-plane gap of 
\begin_inset Formula $D=80\,\text{cm}$
\end_inset
, a tip radius 
\begin_inset Formula $R=0.1\,\text{cm}$
\end_inset
, a first-streamer inception voltage of 
\begin_inset Formula $27.5\,\text{kV}$
\end_inset
, a streamer length 
\begin_inset Formula $L_{cs}=2.7\,\text{cm}$
\end_inset
, a field of about 
\begin_inset Formula $E_{c}=5\,\text{kV/cm}$
\end_inset
 in the streamer region, and the “usual” constants 
\begin_inset Formula $B=1.5$
\end_inset
 and 
\begin_inset Formula $C\approx0.035\,\text{cm}$
\end_inset
. It does not give the cone angle 
\begin_inset Formula $\theta_{B}$
\end_inset
, the amplitude 
\begin_inset Formula $A$
\end_inset
, or how 
\begin_inset Formula $A$
\end_inset
 was chosen. We close the model as follows: 
\begin_inset Formula $A$
\end_inset
 follows from the streamer charge 
\begin_inset Formula $Q_{cs}$
\end_inset
 obtained with Gauss's law (Section 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "sec:amplitude_A"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"
tuple "list"

\end_inset

), and 
\begin_inset Formula $\theta_{B}$
\end_inset
 is solved so that the total field at the head of the streamer equals 
\begin_inset Formula $E_{c}$
\end_inset
:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
E_{ex}(L_{cs})+E_{sp}(L_{cs})+E_{I_{rod}}(L_{cs})+E_{I_{plane}}(L_{cs})=E_{c}.\label{eq:repro_theta_condition}
\end{equation}
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Each trial angle changes 
\begin_inset Formula $Q_{cs}$
\end_inset
 and 
\begin_inset Formula $A$
\end_inset
, so the condition is solved by root finding over 
\begin_inset Formula $\theta_{B}$
\end_inset
. The result is listed in 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand formatted
reference "tab:repro_fig3_params"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"
tuple "list"

\end_inset
.
\end_layout

